{{!
    @template tool_vae/import_dossier_page

    The page "Réimporter un dossier", between its header or heading and the footer: the notification that the sub-system of
    competencies is off; or what the page is for, the notice that a withdrawal does not reach an archive, and the form.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\import_dossier_page. The template holds no logic:
    the states exclude one another before. Every text is escaped (double braces), except two keys of HTML made by the core
    (triple braces): noticehtml, a notification ($output->notification()); formhtml, the form of the core
    (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - false, or a string: what the page is for
    * noticehtml - HTML: the notification (off, or the notice on withdrawals)
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form to choose the archive

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "Rebuild the dossier of this account from an archive.",
        "noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\">A withdrawal does not reach an archive.</div>",
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/import_dossier.php\"></form>"
    }
}}
{{#intro}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{/intro}}
{{#noticehtml}}
{{{noticehtml}}}
{{/noticehtml}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
